  "model": "s2.1-pro-free",
  "text": "Mara says: “Take this copy with you. Tell Grandma I still want to hear her stories, too.”\n\nLive feedback is currently unavailable for this activity. Hints are prepared story help.\n\nSol says: “I could try that. I'll bring my draft and ask what people want to know next.”\n\nI couldn't check that response reliably. You can reread the account or continue playing.\n\nGrandma has the seed from the seed boat. Pip is here now, so they can plant it together.\n\nPip promised to plant a lantern seed with Grandma. The storm washed away the footbridge.\n\nThe boat has reached the bank. Drag back toward open water, or turn with the arrow keys.\n\nGrandma is collecting the seed. You can meet her at the planting spot when she returns.\n\nGuide Pip with the arrow keys or click a place. Your actions happen here in the garden.\n\nThe tape missed the tear. The wing is still loose. Move the same strip across the tear.\n\nGrandma can reach the boat at her blue landing. Steer there before giving her the seed.\n\nLoop plays your complete story. You can pause, replay or open reading help at any time.\n\nPreviewing does not send invitations. Confirm the plan, then check who needs an update.\n\nProgress stays in this browser. Starting a new adventure keeps an archive of this one.\n\nThe ropes are released into Pip’s backpack. Move the sections, then fasten them again.\n\nRina checks that the flour is dry. Sol packs his tools and walks back to his workshop.\n\nMara has finished work. She walks across the secured footbridge to join the gathering.\n\nThe repaired roof kept the flour dry. Rina used it to bake the bread she had promised.\n\nDrag a picture to put it earlier or later in your telling. The storyboard is optional.\n\nYou can practise without the microphone. Microphone access is not available right now.",
  "textSha256": "9aaa4bbbf53cc161545e37b179d7938420d723e7c7770b8a1722d237f1358600",
